# Gallery wall (issue 034, redrawn from the close-up): the ten pieces in their real arrangement, 6x1 tiles, on the south wall face behind the sofa. Silver landscape, gold house, white-and-gold architecture, wolf print in a pale frame, ornate small frames, dark boxed painting, cafe print, postcard. Frames keep their real finishes; the pictures are blurry impressions.
size: 96x16
